### Endpoint Hola mundo

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/sprints



### Probar suma
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma?num1=100&num2=15

### Probar suma 2
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 50,
    "num2": 30
}

### Probar dividir
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/dividir
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 300,
    "num2": 10
}

### Probar base de datos
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/sprints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sprint 1",
    "fecha_inicio": "2025-01-01",
    "fecha_fin": "2025-01-15"
}